Package: cpu-freq
Version: @VERSION@
Architecture: @ARCH@
Maintainer: @MAINT@
Installed-Size: @SIZE@
Depends: @SHLIBS@, pkexec | policykit-1
Recommends: auto-cpufreq, libayatana-appindicator3-1
Suggests: cpu-freq-xfce
Section: utils
Priority: optional
Homepage: https://github.com/WrkForMars/cpu-freq
Description: CPU speedometer and speed limiter
 Shows the current frequency, CPU governor, temperature, battery, RAM and
 swap, and lets you cap the speed at the frequencies your processor
 supports, with or without turbo, through a small polkit-authorized
 helper. If auto-cpufreq is installed, the choice is saved in its
 configuration. Light, dark and AMOLED themes; English, Spanish,
 Portuguese, French and German; optional tray icon.
